{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy to .clasp.json and fill in scriptId. .clasp.json is gitignored:",
    "the script id is not a secret, but it is per-deployment, and pinning",
    "one in the repo makes it far too easy to `clasp push` over the wrong",
    "project.",
    "",
    "Get the id from the Apps Script editor URL:",
    "  script.google.com/home/projects/<scriptId>/edit",
    "",
    "You must be logged in as the DEDICATED ROLE ACCOUNT, not as yourself.",
    "See README.md."
  ],
  "scriptId": "PUT-THE-SCRIPT-ID-HERE",
  "rootDir": "."
}
